<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20068" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλασφημ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>word of evil omen, profane
			speech</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				25.26
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλασφημίαν ἐφθέγξατο</span>, at
			a sacrifice, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1189
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴ τις παραστὰς τοῖς βωμοῖς βλασφημοῖ
					β. πᾶσαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					800c
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσαν β. ἱερῶν
			καταχέουσι</span> ib.d. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>defamation, slander</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				177
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				10.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.95
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β. ποιεῖσθαι εἴς τινα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.167
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.Eph.</u>
				4.31
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅλας ἁμάξας βλασφημιῶν</span>
			whole cart-loads <i>of abuse</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Eun.</u>
				2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>irreverent speech against God, blasphemy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ εἰς τὸ θεῖον β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					715
				</span></i>
			: in pl., <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				35.12
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ Πνεύματος</span>”
				<i>against . . ,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ev.Matt.
					12.31
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸν θεόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Apoc.</u>
					13.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
